        <div class="qa-body"><p>No. You remain the pastor. It checks the inbox, evidence, replies and gaps before sending. You make every decision.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="qa-head">
          <span class="qn">Q2</span>
          <h4>Will this work with my church's process?</h4>
          <span class="qa-tog">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-body"><p>Yes. Use it as a pre-check before your normal reply, safeguarding or finance process. It fits around what you already do.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="qa-head">
          <span class="qn">Q3</span>
          <h4>What about member data?</h4>
          <span class="qa-tog">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-body"><p>Data is handled under your church-approved process. Add your privacy and safeguarding wording here. We walk through the exact data handling on the call.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="qa-head">
          <span class="qn">Q4</span>
          <h4>What if the diocese still asks a question?</h4>
          <span class="qa-tog">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-body"><p>Some queries cannot be avoided. But reviewed inboxes reduce the avoidable ones: the missed bereavement, the expired DBS, the unfiled Gift Aid.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="qa-head">
          <span class="qn">Q5</span>
          <h4>Can it draft email and WhatsApp messages?</h4>
          <span class="qa-tog">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-body"><p>Yes. Pastoral replies, volunteer follow-ups, and donor wording, all drafted from the actual message. You review before sending.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <div class="qa-head">
          <span class="qn">Q6</span>
          <h4>What happens on the demo call?</h4>
          <span class="qa-tog">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-body"><p>Bring one live week of inbox. We review it together in about 20 minutes. You see the flags, the drafted replies, and the missing items. Then you decide if it is worth continuing.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

